Ontology(<https://example.org/temporal-kg/v2>
Annotation(rdfs:comment "Draft standalone OWL 2 DL core. Local PRO vocabulary; no full SULO or OWL-Time import. Numeric temporal and evidence-selection operations are specified separately in the companion document.")
Declaration(Class(:TemporalEntity))
Declaration(Class(:TimePoint))
Declaration(Class(:TimeInterval))
Declaration(Class(:Process))
Declaration(Class(:InstantaneousProcess))
Declaration(Class(:ExtendedProcess))
Declaration(Class(:TemporalSituation))
Declaration(Class(:BedOccupancySituation))
